REGION Ra1 5
	+Ra1
REGION Ra2 5
	+Ra2
REGION Ra3 5
	+Ra3
REGION Ra4 5
	+Ra4
REGION H2O 5
	+shell -Al1 -Al2 -Al3 -Al4 -Ta1 -Ta2 -Ta3 -Ti1 -Ti2 
END
GEOEND
MATERIAL RADIUM 88,, 5.0
*..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
ASSIGNMA , BLCKHOLE BLKBODY
ASSIGNMA , VACUUM VOID
ASSIGNMA , TITANIUM Ti1 Ti2
