*biasing and transport conditions
RADDECAY , 1. 1 3,, 10000100
*Define an irradiation profile for radioactive decay calculations
IRRPROFI , =10*24*3600 =800*6.24e12
*Defines decay times for radioactive product scoring
DCYTIMES , 0 =10*3600*24
!RESNUCLE ra1 3 -21,,, Ra1
!RESNUCLE ra2 3 -21,,, Ra2
!RESNUCLE ra3 3 -21,,, Ra3
!RESNUCLE ra4 3 -21,,, Ra4
RESNUCLE al4 3 -21,,, Al4
RESNUCLE ti2 3 -23,,, Ti2
*Associates selected scoring detectors with user-defined decay times
DCYSCORE RESNUCLE 2,,, al4 al4
*Associates selected scoring detectors with user-defined decay times
DCYSCORE RESNUCLE 2,,, ti2 ti2
USRBIN us1 10 NEUTRON -22 4 0.5 1 1 -0.5 -1 99 1 99
*Associates selected scoring detectors with user-defined decay times
DCYSCORE USRBIN 1,,, us1 us1
*Set the random number seed
RANDOMIZ , 1.0
*Set the number of primary histories to be simulated in the run
START , 1000000
STOP
